{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1112639-the-telchines-a-little-known-pantheon-to-play-with","id":1112639,"title":"The Telchines! A little known Pantheon to play with!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-07-07T06:31:52-07:00","id":1112639,"title":"The Telchines! A little known Pantheon to play with!","content":"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Telchines\" target=\"_blank\">The Telchines</a> were a minor Pantheon worshiped on the Isle of <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rhodes#Early_and_classical_antiquity\" target=\"_blank\">Rhodes</a> in ancient time. And a great resource. They're either a lost or fallen pantheon and one that can be used as a blank slate. They are both seen as mentors of the Greek Gods and ancient foes. This means lots of story hooks.<br /> <br /> A character could be one of the last scions of the Telchines seeking redemption or may be revenge. PCs could be seeking the ancient secrets of the Techines. Or maybe you just want to use the Atlantean Pantheon material with real deities and deity names.<br /> <br /> Whatever. The Telchines are a resource.<br /> <br /> Here's another source on the <a href=\"http://www.theoi.com/Pontios/Telkhines.html\" target=\"_blank\">Telkhines</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":857,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","user":"Astromancer","date":". 07-07-2017, 09:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T11:43:58-07:00","id":1113801,"title":"","content":"It seems the Telchines had a Scion in Greek myth! One <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Euxantius\" target=\"_blank\">Euxantius</a>. He seems to have been a King bound somehow to his own realm.<br /> <br /> Still, his mother Dexithea or Dexinoe, would likely have one or more of Magic, Water, Sky, and Darkness, purviews and possibly Health, Earth, Illusion, or Mystery as well. Aquatic Animals are also possible. Magic is almost certain, the next three are very likely.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T11:50:04-07:00","id":1113805,"title":"","content":"Telkhines were the enemy in Titan Quest, an action rpg at least initially set in ancient Greece.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2367-resplendent-fire","name":"Resplendent Fire","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2367_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1887"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-09T13:45:44-07:00","id":1113863,"title":"","content":"Lacking knowledge of any of their individuals and myths as worshipped indigenously, I'm more inclined to just use them as they appear in Greek Myth - oceanic titanspawn subdued into crafters for the gods who may still hold a grudge and be willing to rebel/align with the Titans, given the opportunity.<br /> <br /> Maybe I'd have them claim to have once been a pantheon in their own right but were beaten down to their current state by the Theoi.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 07-11-2017, 05:09 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}